Usage:
  minder provider [flags]
  minder provider [command]

Available Commands:
  delete      Delete a given provider available in a specific project
  enroll      Enroll a provider within the minder control plane
  get         Get a given provider available in a specific project
  list        List the providers available in a specific project
  update      Updates a provider's configuration

Flags:
  -h, --help             help for provider
  -j, --project string   ID of the project

Global Flags:
      --config string            Config file (default is $PWD/config.yaml)
      --grpc-host string         Server host (default "api.custcodian.dev")
      --grpc-insecure            Allow establishing insecure connections
      --grpc-port int            Server port (default 443)
      --identity-client string   Identity server client ID (default "minder-cli")
      --identity-url string      Identity server issuer URL (default "https://auth.custcodian.dev")
  -v, --verbose                  Output additional messages to STDERR

Use "minder provider [command] --help" for more information about a command.
